    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d655ea564803c07b",
      "translationZh": "将表以 Parquet 文件的形式上传到 Hugging Face Hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58c82e9caa2d4103",
      "translationZh": "从 pyarrow>=21.0.0 开始，我们可以在 pyarrow 函数中使用 Hugging Face URI，通过 hf:// URI 方案直接读取和写入 Hub 上的 parquet 文件（以及其他格式的文件）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62d990781b924d41",
      "translationZh": "我们可以看到，整张表都作为新数据上传了（total bytes == total transfer），因为 Xet 存储层尚未识别这些数据。现在将其读回为 pyarrow 表：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69e68abb702d8804",
      "translationZh": "请注意，所有接受文件路径的 pyarrow 函数也都接受 Hugging Face URI，例如 pyarrow 数据集、CSV 函数、增量 Parquet 写入器，或仅读取 parquet 元数据的函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3d74e9d662e3534",
      "translationZh": "Parquet 去重的不同用例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ab32cf64f0c2090",
      "translationZh": "为了展示内容定义分块功能的有效性，我们将尝试看看它在以下情况下的表现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df5a03f5b4a202d3",
      "translationZh": "重新上传该表的完全相同副本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70bb229c7fa7865a",
      "translationZh": "在表中添加/删除列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "033ab21ec46b4d08",
      "translationZh": "更改表中列的类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc3a186c124b458d",
      "translationZh": "追加新行并拼接表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ec75319d798eae5",
      "translationZh": "在表中插入/删除行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ea6dd73b3e23f0e",
      "translationZh": "更改表的行组大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da9dd24d051ea614",
      "translationZh": "使用不同的文件级拆分方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d5494d1771d57ee5",
      "translationZh": "1. 重新上传表的完全相同副本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "105531b8aae740c4",
      "translationZh": "虽然这个用例听起来很简单，但传统文件系统不会对文件进行去重，因此会重新上传和重新下载全部数据。相比之下，采用内容定义分块的系统能够识别出文件内容完全相同，从而避免不必要的数据传输。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbcfb4bd5c815171",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，没有上传任何新数据，而且操作瞬间就完成了。现在来看看，如果再次上传同一个文件，但上传到另一个仓库，会发生什么：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd5b1151ebd574e4",
      "translationZh": "这次上传同样瞬间就完成了，因为去重也能跨仓库生效。这是 Xet 存储层的一项关键特性，能够实现高效的数据共享与协作。有关具体细节和规模扩展方面的挑战，可以阅读《从数据块到存储块：加速 Hub 上的上传与下载》（From Chunks to Blocks: Accelerating Uploads and Downloads on the Hub）这篇博文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e826822ca72e25e1",
      "translationZh": "2. 向表中添加列和从表中删除列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcdddb5e3466d652",
      "translationZh": "首先，将原始表和修改后的表写入本地 parquet 文件，查看它们的大小：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70a6ff6aefaffc8e",
      "translationZh": "现在将它们上传到 Hugging Face，看看实际传输了多少数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dd3cac1efecad8d",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，只有新增的列和位于文件尾部的新增 parquet 元数据被上传，原始数据则没有再次传输。这是 Xet 存储层的一大优势，因为它使我们能够高效地添加新列，而无需再次传输整个数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9a639eceac450c1",
      "translationZh": "删除列时也是如此，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e46f82e2ad9b49f",
      "translationZh": "为了更好地了解上传了哪些内容，我们可以使用去重估算工具，将两个 parquet 文件之间的差异可视化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b9c95b4990ec281",
      "translationZh": "添加新列后",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278b1b2a9c84730f",
      "translationZh": "压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1f24351bc87f5f",
      "translationZh": "原生 Parquet",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e94de7fbe897a349",
      "translationZh": "新增两列意味着出现了此前未见过的数据页，必须传输这些数据页（以红色突出显示），但其余数据保持不变（以绿色突出显示），因此不会再次传输。请注意，页脚元数据中有一小块红色区域，每当我们修改 parquet 文件时，这部分几乎总会发生变化。去重统计显示的是 <deduped size> / <total size> = <dedup ratio>，比率越小，表示去重效果越好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e979d1e1ec5d138",
      "translationZh": "再来看一下删除一列后的差异可视化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "51aa9f7a56d8d621",
      "translationZh": "删除列后",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278b1b2a9c84730f",
      "translationZh": "压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1f24351bc87f5f",
      "translationZh": "原生 Parquet",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c4d0eea61649ef3",
      "translationZh": "由于我们移除的是整列，因此只能看到文件尾部元数据发生变化，所有其他列都保持不变，并且已存在于存储层中，所以不会再次传输。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1653e197408d64ef",
      "translationZh": "3. 更改表中的列类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7a72d5406d70967",
      "translationZh": "另一个常见用例是更改表中的列类型，例如减小存储大小，或针对特定查询优化数据。让我们将 question_length 列的数据类型从 int64 更改为 int32，看看会传输多少数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "350120d8a5d79fcb",
      "translationZh": "同样，我们可以看到，只有新列和更新后的 parquet 元数据被上传。现在将去重热力图可视化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7888697f4766446f",
      "translationZh": "使用类型转换后的列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278b1b2a9c84730f",
      "translationZh": "压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1f24351bc87f5f",
      "translationZh": "原生 Parquet",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "414ec3692a3a16ed",
      "translationZh": "第一个红色区域表示新增的列，第二个红色区域表示文件尾部中更新后的元数据。其余数据保持不变，不会再次传输。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1034144625da3bc9",
      "translationZh": "4. 追加新行与拼接表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2c595220af839f8",
      "translationZh": "我们将把原始数据集的另一个切片拼接到表中，以追加新行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2111e2b58b9d0e31",
      "translationZh": "现在检查是否只上传了新行，因为 Xet 存储层已经知晓原始数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "503c45c6fb0b1ee5",
      "translationZh": "追加行后",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278b1b2a9c84730f",
      "translationZh": "压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1f24351bc87f5f",
      "translationZh": "原生 Parquet",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2d96a816a06ff",
      "translationZh": "去重统计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a93517d1306d9d63",
      "translationZh": "由于每一列都有新数据，我们可以看到多个红色区域。这是由实际的 parquet 文件规范决定的：在每个行组内，各列的完整数据依次排列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "18910a54a22e0b58",
      "translationZh": "5. 在表中插入 / 删除行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1514794735cc7ef5",
      "translationZh": "难点来了：插入和删除会使现有行发生位移，导致列块（column chunks）或数据页（data pages，parquet 术语）发生变化。由于每个数据页都是单独压缩的，即使只插入或删除一行，也可能导致从被编辑的行开始直到 parquet 文件末尾的字节级表示完全不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4d7d6466cb101dd",
      "translationZh": "这个 parquet 特有的问题无法仅靠 Xet 存储层解决；parquet 文件本身需要采用一种写入方式，即使有行被插入或删除，也能尽量减少数据页的差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51df212c7956f21e",
      "translationZh": "让我们尝试使用现有机制，看看它的表现如何。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dab2507d95d79b79",
      "translationZh": "同时将这两种情况可视化，看看它们的差异：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7b91cdffed02406",
      "translationZh": "已删除的行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278b1b2a9c84730f",
      "translationZh": "压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1f24351bc87f5f",
      "translationZh": "原版 Parquet",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
